FMutate expressive controls for FM-106 (GPL-3.0-only, preserving upstream attribution).

Adds per-channel volatile MIDI pitch bend (0xEn, +-2 semitones default or scaled by B.DCO,
center 8192, endpoints 0/16383; panel keys follow the active MIDI channel's bend) and
per-note square-law MIDI polyphonic key pressure (0xAn, 127 unity skipped, 0 silent) via
independent per-voice smoothed Q15 gain with channel/source-key isolation (including MONO
unison stack and arpeggiator octaves) and new-note/retrigger/reuse reset; CC120/123 release
notes and keep a held bend, CC121 resets bend, pressure and hold pedal.
Neutral sound without pressure/bend is unchanged and persisted settings are untouched.

